Comment:
 The gpu-port-kit code, shaders and runners are MIT-licensed (see
 gpu-port-kit/LICENSE in the source).
 .
 MODEL WEIGHTS ARE NOT INCLUDED IN THIS PACKAGE. They are downloaded on first
 run by /usr/lib/oido-dictate/fetch-models.sh from their upstream sources and
 keep their own licenses:
   - Oido nemo8 speech model + language model (nemo8.tnm, nemo_lm.tlm, from
     lokutor-ai/oido-ctc-small-int8 on Hugging Face): CC-BY-4.0 per the
     upstream model card (attribution required; no share-alike). Verify on the
     model page before redistributing. The GPU blob nemo8_kit.bin is generated
     locally on the user's machine from nemo8.tnm and is not distributed.
   - sherpa-onnx online punctuation model (k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx): Apache-2.0
     (verify on the release page).
 Because the weights are fetched, not shipped, this package does not
 redistribute them; downstream redistributors who choose to bundle the weights
 must comply with the licenses above.
